1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,484
Exam tip.

2
00:00:01,484 --> 00:00:06,276
A blood group test can exclude a man: it can show he cannot be the father.

3
00:00:06,276 --> 00:00:11,263
It can never prove that he is, because millions of other men share his group.

4
00:00:11,263 --> 00:00:13,580
Write could be, and cannot be.

5
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:14,544
Never is.

